Description: CVE-2026-62363 - Fix heap buffer over-write in fx operation (SetPtrShortExp)
 The fx expression parser's SetPtrShortExp() helper copies the caller-supplied
 expression fragment into the fixed-size FxInfo.ShortExp buffer
 (char ShortExp[MagickPathExtent]) using CopyMagickString() bounded by the
 caller-provided "len" argument rather than by the actual destination buffer
 size. A caller such as the parser error path passes an attacker-controlled
 length (pel->exp_len+1) that can exceed MagickPathExtent, causing
 CopyMagickString() to write past the end of the ShortExp buffer -- a heap
 buffer over-write (GHSA-422r-8c97-xcg4).
 .
 Bound the copy to the true destination buffer size (MagickPathExtent) so the
 report buffer can never be overrun, regardless of the caller-supplied length.
 This matches the authoritative upstream fix, whose final form bounds the copy
 to MagickPathExtent.
Origin: upstream, commit:be99ffaa57c8f91ed8897c2221ff0940c561a368, commit:0bbf7e48f5dd0ef540d3ae1ae8dfc6cd036fb640
Author: Cristy <urban-warrior@imagemagick.org>
Bug: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-422r-8c97-xcg4
Last-Update: 2026-07-31
---
--- a/MagickCore/fx.c
+++ b/MagickCore/fx.c
@@ -871,7 +871,7 @@ static char * SetPtrShortExp (FxInfo * p
   *pfx->ShortExp = '\0';

   if (pExp && len) {
-    slen = CopyMagickString (pfx->ShortExp, pExp, len);
+    slen = CopyMagickString (pfx->ShortExp, pExp, MagickPathExtent);
     if (slen > MaxLen) { 
       (void) CopyMagickString (pfx->ShortExp+MaxLen, "...", 4);
     }
Description: CVE-2026-62946 - Fix integer overflow / heap buffer over-write in JNX coder
 When processing large JNX files the tile_length value read from the file can be
 close to UINT_MAX. The subsequent allocation of tile_length+2 bytes overflows on
 32-bit platforms, resulting in an undersized buffer and a heap buffer over-write
 (CWE-190). Add a bounds check that rejects tile_length values greater than
 UINT_MAX-2 before the allocation.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/538ad18f3a421d1dd9629baa747eebc137c32b67
Bug: GHSA-h22j-f9xw-xjjm
Author: ImageMagick upstream
Last-Update: 2026-08-01
